  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Genebank Support Art 15</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of this fund is to support Article 15 Genebanks of the Treaty for Plant Genetic Resources housed in the FAO. This project will support three of the article 15 genebanks namely ICRAF in Kenya, World Veg in Tanzania and Icrisat in India. The three genebanks in question support the conservation and development of genetic material (seeds) which are specifically  relevant for and often from ODA countries. The collections in the Genbanks are used by many research institutions - not least CGIAR and African National Agricultural research centers (NARS) - for ODA countries.</narrative>
  </description>
